<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no" />
  <title>我的第一个小应用</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    h1 { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    p  { font-size: 15px; opacity: 0.85; margin-bottom: 28px; text-align: center; }
    .count {
      font-size: 56px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    button {
      border: none;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px 36px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #764ba2;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:active { transform: scale(0.96); }
    .reset {
      margin-top: 14px;
      background: transparent;
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      box-shadow: none;
      padding: 10px 24px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>👋 你好，这是我的小应用</h1>
  <p>点下面的按钮试试，这就是套壳成 APK 后手机上看到的界面</p>
  <div class="count" id="count">0</div>
  <button onclick="add()">点我 +1</button>
  <button class="reset" onclick="reset()">清零</button>

  <script>
    let n = 0;
    const el = document.getElementById('count');
    function add() { n++; el.textContent = n; }
    function reset() { n = 0; el.textContent = n; }
  </script>
</body>
</html>